*.csv
!Thirdparty/**/*.csv
*.log
log.txt
**/tag_export*/
scripts/*_out/
CameraTrajectory*.txt
KeyFrameTrajectory*.txt
OnlineCameraTrajectory*.txt
Examples/TagFusion/**/f_*.txt
Examples/TagFusion/**/kf_*.txt

